      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 7.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "doctor, I've checked them in and done the preliminary measurements, I'll hand them over when you ask"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.23,
      "end_seconds": 16.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 18.31,
      "end_seconds": 29.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details. It's been feeling overwhelmed at work, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.76,
      "end_seconds": 35.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 37.19,
      "end_seconds": 50.34,
      "duration_seconds": 13.15,
      "text": "He is on omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day, I give it to him. He is on escitalopram, once a day for the anxiety, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.64,
      "end_seconds": 55.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 56.41,
      "end_seconds": 64.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "it's 10 milligrams. He is on paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed, I give it to him"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.61,
      "end_seconds": 67.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "roughly when did it start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.39,
      "end_seconds": 70.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "About... well, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.11,
      "end_seconds": 83.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "Alright, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.69,
      "end_seconds": 121.16,
      "duration_seconds": 37.47,
      "text": "Deadlines definitely sets it off it settles a little with weekends off. Moderate, really oh, and a knot in my stomach as for trouble switching off at night, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before as for trouble switching off at night, it's every other day i did have headaches in the evening at one point, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.67,
      "end_seconds": 133.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Any weight loss or fainting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.56,
      "end_seconds": 137.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, no weight loss or fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.35,
      "end_seconds": 145.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "any chest pain, alcohol use or thoughts of harming myself at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.46,
      "end_seconds": 152.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain, alcohol use or thoughts of harming myself, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.79,
      "end_seconds": 156.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "And And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.49,
      "end_seconds": 159.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.5,
      "end_seconds": 162.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.25,
      "end_seconds": 164.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "nothing else aches"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.66,
      "end_seconds": 170.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.04,
      "end_seconds": 178.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "I mean, I've had acid reflux for about a year now. I've got anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.75,
      "end_seconds": 187.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "alright, acid reflux, that matches what I have here do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.22,
      "end_seconds": 201.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.95,
      "text": "yes, peanuts, it gives me my lips swelling yes, penicillin i've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.0,
      "end_seconds": 204.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.76,
      "end_seconds": 218.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.27,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have. I play badminton on Sundays. I work on a farm, it's quite physical."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.12,
      "end_seconds": 221.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.55,
      "end_seconds": 226.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "I had a hernia repair about five years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 228.17,
      "end_seconds": 236.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pressure 113 over 68, saturation 99 percent, pulse 78, temp 37.0 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.48,
      "end_seconds": 238.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.93,
      "end_seconds": 263.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "from what you've told me, it points towards stress-related symptoms. I can't rule out an anxiety disorder yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.22,
      "end_seconds": 267.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Do you think it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.7,
      "end_seconds": 277.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's stress-related symptoms, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.34,
      "end_seconds": 293.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "alright, today I'm not changing anything look after yourself"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.04,
      "end_seconds": 298.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "no, you've explained it well thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.58,
